{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_213_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_213","textTraditional":"一、三十有二年，春，王正月，公在乾侯。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_213_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_213","textTraditional":"二、取闞。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_213_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_213","textTraditional":"三、夏，吳伐越。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_213_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_213","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_213_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_213","textTraditional":"五、冬，仲孫何忌會晉韓不信、齊高張、宋仲幾、衞大叔申、鄭國參、曹人、莒人、邾人、薛人、杞人、小邾人城成周。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_213_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_213","textTraditional":"天子微，諸侯不享覲。天子之在者，惟祭與號。故諸侯之大夫相帥以城之，此變之正也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_213_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_213","textTraditional":"六、十有二月，己未，公薨於乾侯。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}